    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d804">

                <pb facs="0905" n="809" xml:id="pg809"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-11-08"><hi rendition="#italic">November 8,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If the provisional government is effectively administering government of nation
                    and in position to fulfill international obligations, you will enter into de
                    facto relations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
